# Try the API from VS Code (REST Client) or Visual Studio / Rider.
# Start the app first: dotnet run --project exercises/01-refactor/order-api-pipeline/OrderApiPipeline
@host = http://localhost:5000

### Place an order
POST {{host}}/orders
X-Customer-Id: anna
Content-Type: application/json

{ "lines": [ { "productId": "HAMMER", "quantity": 2 }, { "productId": "SAW", "quantity": 1 } ] }

### List my orders
GET {{host}}/orders
X-Customer-Id: anna

### Get one order
GET {{host}}/orders/1
X-Customer-Id: anna

### Cancel it
POST {{host}}/orders/1/cancel
X-Customer-Id: anna

### Ship it (staff only)
POST {{host}}/orders/1/ship
X-Customer-Id: lager-lisa
X-Role: staff
